{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38152","headline":"北齐二首 一 · 韩偓","name":"北齐二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"任道骄奢必败亡，且将繁盛悦嫔嫱。\n几千籢镜成楼柱，六十间云号殿廊。\n後主猎回初按乐，胡姬酒醒更新妆。\n绮罗堆里春风畔，年少多情一帝王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38152.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38152","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}